{
  "uid": "codexlb-agent-tree",
  "title": "codexlb2otel: Agent tree",
  "description": "Spawn rate, subagent kind mix, and agent-message topology from the wire capture.",
  "tags": [
    "codexlb2otel",
    "codex-lb",
    "agents"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service_name",
        "label": "Service",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "grafanacloud-prom"
        },
        "query": "label_values(codexlb_responses_total, service_name)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false,
        "regex": "",
        "current": {
          "selected": false,
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "The agent tree: spawn rate, subagent kind mix, and agent-to-agent message topology. Complements `codex-lb-overview` (the proxy's own Postgres-derived view); every panel here is built from the wire-capture telemetry only codexlb2otel emits. **Subagent depth (chain length) is NOT built here.** It requires walking parent_thread_id/forked_from_thread_id/parent_turn_id chains recursively - graph traversal no PromQL or LogQL aggregation performs. Every turn record carries thread_id, parent_thread_id, forked_from_thread_id and parent_turn_id (internal/attr/attr.go's Identity registry), so the raw material is there; depth itself needs an external job (or a future codexlb2otel-side reducer) to materialize, not a dashboard query. The table below is a browsable proxy: distinct parent/child thread pairs seen in the window."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Agent spawn rate, by model",
      "description": "codexlb.tool_calls, filtered to gen_ai.tool.name=\"spawn_agent\".",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "last"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "grafanacloud-prom"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (gen_ai_request_model) (rate(codexlb_tool_calls_total{service_name=~\"$service_name\", gen_ai_tool_name=\"spawn_agent\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "{{gen_ai_request_model}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Turns by thread source (user vs subagent)",
      "description": "codexlb.turns, by codexlb.thread_source.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "last"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "grafanacloud-prom"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (codexlb_thread_source) (rate(codexlb_turns_total{service_name=~\"$service_name\", codexlb_family!=\"probe\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "{{codexlb_thread_source}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Subagent kind mix",
      "description": "collab_spawn | thread_spawn | memory_consolidation (attr.go's Observed set).",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "last"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "grafanacloud-prom"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (codexlb_subagent_kind) (rate(codexlb_turns_total{service_name=~\"$service_name\", codexlb_thread_source=\"subagent\", codexlb_family!=\"probe\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "{{codexlb_subagent_kind}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Agent-to-agent messages, rate",
      "description": "Volume of AgentMessage lines (author/recipient task-path pairs).",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "last"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "grafanacloud-logs"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service_name=\"$service_name\", codexlb_record_type=\"agent_message\"} [$__interval]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "[Loki] Agent-message topology (author -> recipient), this window",
      "description": "turn.AgentMessage.Author/Recipient are task paths (e.g. /root/lab_baseline), reconstructing multi-agent communication topology.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "grafanacloud-logs"
          },
          "expr": "topk(20, sum by (author, recipient) (count_over_time({service_name=\"$service_name\", codexlb_record_type=\"agent_message\"} | json author=\"author\", recipient=\"recipient\" [$__range])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "[Loki] Parent/child thread pairs seen this window (depth proxy)",
      "description": "Not a depth metric - a browsable sample of thread parentage. True depth needs recursive traversal outside LogQL.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "grafanacloud-logs"
          },
          "expr": "{service_name=\"$service_name\", codexlb_record_type=\"turn\"} | json thread_id=\"thread_id\", parent_thread_id=\"parent_thread_id\", forked_from_thread_id=\"forked_from_thread_id\", subagent_kind=\"subagent_kind\" | parent_thread_id != \"\" or forked_from_thread_id != \"\"",
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
